{"schemaVersion":"1.0.0","readme":"","modules":[{"kind":"javascript-module","path":"src/backdrop.ts","declarations":[{"kind":"class","description":"A container that draws a decorative background behind its content: a hero, a landing section, an empty state. The\ncontent sits above the pattern, in normal flow.\n\n`pattern` picks what is drawn: `dots`, `grid` and `stripes` are still; `flicker` lights squares of a fine grid at\nrandom, `aurora` drifts soft colour, and `meteors` sends streaks across now and then. Colours, spacing and the fade\nare CSS variables: by default the pattern fades toward the edges (`--c2-backdrop__mask--image`), and its colour is a\ngrey that reads in both themes.\n\nThe pattern is hidden from assistive technology and never takes focus or the pointer. A moving pattern stops while\nit is off screen or the page is hidden, and under reduced motion it stays still.","name":"Backdrop","cssProperties":[{"type":{"text":"color"},"description":"The dots, lines and squares.","name":"--c2-backdrop--color","default":"rgba(113, 113, 122, 0.35)"},{"type":{"text":"pixel"},"description":"The spacing of the dots, grid, stripes and flicker squares.","name":"--c2-backdrop--size","default":"16px"},{"type":{"text":"pixel"},"description":"The radius of a dot.","name":"--c2-backdrop__dot--size","default":"1px"},{"type":{"text":"pixel"},"description":"The width of a grid or stripe line.","name":"--c2-backdrop__line--width","default":"1px"},{"type":{"text":"background"},"description":"Fades the pattern; `none` keeps it even.","name":"--c2-backdrop__mask--image","default":"radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #000 35%, transparent 80%)"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"description":"Behind the pattern.","name":"--c2-backdrop--background","default":"transparent"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"description":"The squares that light up.","name":"--c2-backdrop__flicker--color","default":"rgb(2, 101, 220)"},{"type":{"text":"number"},"description":"The brightest a square gets.","name":"--c2-backdrop__flicker--opacity","default":"0.6"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-backdrop__aurora--color-1","default":"#60a5fa"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-backdrop__aurora--color-2","default":"#c084fc"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-backdrop__aurora--color-3","default":"#34d399"},{"type":{"text":"number"},"name":"--c2-backdrop__aurora--opacity","default":"0.5"},{"type":{"text":"pixel"},"name":"--c2-backdrop__aurora--blur","default":"48px"},{"type":{"text":"time"},"description":"One drift of the aurora.","name":"--c2-backdrop__aurora--duration","default":"18s"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-backdrop__meteor--color","default":"#71717a"},{"type":{"text":"number"},"description":"How many meteors there are.","name":"--c2-backdrop__meteor--count","default":"12"},{"type":{"text":"pixel"},"name":"--c2-backdrop__meteor--length","default":"80px"},{"type":{"text":"padding"},"description":"Space around the content.","name":"--c2-backdrop--padding","default":"0px"}],"cssParts":[{"description":"The pattern layer.","name":"pattern"},{"description":"The box around the content.","name":"content"}],"slots":[{"description":"The content drawn above the pattern.","name":""}],"members":[{"kind":"field","name":"pattern","type":{"text":"BackdropPattern"},"default":"'dots'","description":"`dots`, `grid`, `stripes`, `flicker`, `aurora` or `meteors`.","attribute":"pattern"},{"kind":"field","name":"meteors","type":{"text":"Meteor[]"},"privacy":"private","default":"[]","description":"The meteors, made on the client so a server render stays the same as the first client render."},{"kind":"field","name":"paused","type":{"text":"boolean"},"privacy":"private","default":"false"},{"kind":"field","name":"observer","type":{"text":"IntersectionObserver | null"},"privacy":"private","default":"null"},{"kind":"field","name":"resizes","type":{"text":"ResizeObserver | null"},"privacy":"private","default":"null"},{"kind":"field","name":"reducedQuery","type":{"text":"MediaQueryList | null"},"privacy":"private","default":"null"},{"kind":"field","name":"onScreen","type":{"text":"boolean"},"privacy":"private","default":"true"},{"kind":"field","name":"frame","type":{"text":"number"},"privacy":"private","default":"0"},{"kind":"field","name":"lastFlicker","type":{"text":"number"},"privacy":"private","default":"0"},{"kind":"field","name":"cells","type":{"text":"{ value: number; target: number }[]"},"privacy":"private","default":"[]","description":"The flicker grid: one opacity per square, and the target each eases toward."},{"kind":"field","name":"columns","type":{"text":"number"},"privacy":"private","default":"0"},{"kind":"field","name":"rows","type":{"text":"number"},"privacy":"private","default":"0"},{"kind":"field","name":"reduced","type":{"text":"boolean"},"privacy":"private","readonly":true},{"kind":"field","name":"sync","privacy":"private","readonly":true,"description":"Runs or pauses the moving patterns."},{"kind":"method","name":"makeMeteors","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"void"}}},{"kind":"field","name":"canvas","type":{"text":"HTMLCanvasElement | null"},"privacy":"private","readonly":true},{"kind":"field","name":"look","type":{"text":"object"},"privacy":"private","default":"{ size: 16, color: 'rgba(113, 113, 122, 0.35)', lit: 'rgb(2, 101, 220)', opacity: 0.6 }","description":"The flicker's look, read once per layout rather than every frame."},{"kind":"method","name":"layoutFlicker","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"void"}},"description":"Sizes the flicker canvas to the box, one cell per `--c2-backdrop--size`, and reads its colours."},{"kind":"method","name":"startFlicker","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"void"}}},{"kind":"method","name":"stopFlicker","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"void"}}},{"kind":"field","name":"tick","privacy":"private","readonly":true},{"kind":"method","name":"drawFlicker","privacy":"private","return":{"type":{"text":"void"}}},{"kind":"method","name":"renderPattern","privacy":"private"}],"attributes":[{"name":"pattern","type":{"text":"BackdropPattern"},"default":"'dots'","description":"`dots`, `grid`, `stripes`, `flicker`, `aurora` or `meteors`.","fieldName":"pattern"}],"superclass":{"name":"LitElement","package":"lit"},"tagName":"c2-backdrop","customElement":true}],"exports":[{"kind":"js","name":"Backdrop","declaration":{"name":"Backdrop","module":"src/backdrop.ts"}},{"kind":"custom-element-definition","name":"c2-backdrop","declaration":{"name":"Backdrop","module":"src/backdrop.ts"}}]}]}